## Output style

Apply the ADHD-friendly response rules imported below to every response. The
file is the i-have-adhd skill deployed by apm (declared in `~/.apm/apm.yml`,
pinned to a commit there), so the rules stay in one place. The skill itself sets
`disable-model-invocation: true` and cannot be loaded on its own; this import is
what makes it always-on. Codex gets the same rules inlined in `~/.codex/AGENTS.md`.

